    <briefdescription>
<para>Driver for SHT40 temperature &amp; humidity sensor. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This driver provides basic initialization, measurement reading, and serial number retrieval for the SHT40 sensor using the ESP-IDF I2C master driver.</para>
<para>Datasheet: Sensirion SHT40, Version 7.1 March 2025 </para>
